{"seq":3,"slug":"alerting-incident-response","title":"告警与应急响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/platform-operations/alerting-incident-response","wordCount":1390,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"告警与应急响应\">告警与应急响应</h1><p>监控数据的终极价值在于<strong>行动</strong>——当崩溃率突增、关键 API 超时、OOM 频发时，团队能在用户大规模受影响之前介入处理。告警系统是将被动观测转化为主动响应的桥梁，而应急响应流程则确保告警触发后，正确的人在正确的时间做出正确的决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>告警与应急响应的本质是一套<strong>信号→决策→行动</strong>的闭环机制。告警系统将监控数据中的异常模式转化为可操作的通知（信号），On-Call 流程确保正确的人在规定时间内做出响应（决策），Runbook 和发布门控将决策转化为具体的止血和修复动作（行动）。好的告警只在需要人类注意时响铃——告警过多等于没有告警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"告警设计原则\">告警设计原则</h2><p>好的告警只在需要人类注意时响铃。告警过多等于没有告警——&quot;狼来了&quot;效应会让团队习惯性忽略所有通知：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>好告警</th>\n<th>坏告警</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触发条件</td>\n<td>基于异常变化率</td>\n<td>基于绝对阈值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可操作性</td>\n<td>有明确的下一步</td>\n<td>只说&quot;出事了&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降噪</td>\n<td>同类聚合、去重</td>\n<td>每分钟重复发送</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时效性</td>\n<td>按严重度分级通知</td>\n<td>所有都即时通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文</td>\n<td>附带受影响范围和趋势</td>\n<td>仅一行文字</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>告警应回答三个问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>发生了什么</strong>（What）：崩溃率 2 小时内从 99.3% 降到 97.8%</li>\n<li><strong>影响多大</strong>（Impact）：约 12,000 用户受影响，集中在 v3.2.1 + Android 13</li>\n<li><strong>该做什么</strong>（Action）：查看 Crashlytics Issue #4521，考虑回滚 v3.2.1</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"多层告警体系\">多层告警体系</h2><p>不同严重程度的问题需要不同的响应速度和通知渠道：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[监控数据流入] --&gt; B[规则引擎评估]&#10;    B --&gt; C{严重程度}&#10;    C --&gt;|P0 Critical| D[电话+短信+即时消息&lt;br/&gt;5分钟内必须响应]&#10;    C --&gt;|P1 High| E[即时消息+邮件&lt;br/&gt;30分钟内响应]&#10;    C --&gt;|P2 Medium| F[工作时间通知&lt;br/&gt;当日处理]&#10;    C --&gt;|P3 Low| G[周报聚合&lt;br/&gt;下个迭代处理]&#10;&#10;    D --&gt; H[On-Call 值班人]&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; I[功能负责人]&#10;    G --&gt; J[Tech Lead]\">flowchart TD\n    A[监控数据流入] --&gt; B[规则引擎评估]\n    B --&gt; C{严重程度}\n    C --&gt;|P0 Critical| D[电话+短信+即时消息&lt;br/&gt;5分钟内必须响应]\n    C --&gt;|P1 High| E[即时消息+邮件&lt;br/&gt;30分钟内响应]\n    C --&gt;|P2 Medium| F[工作时间通知&lt;br/&gt;当日处理]\n    C --&gt;|P3 Low| G[周报聚合&lt;br/&gt;下个迭代处理]\n\n    D --&gt; H[On-Call 值班人]\n    E --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; I[功能负责人]\n    G --&gt; J[Tech Lead]</pre><p>各层级的触发条件（移动应用典型配置）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>响应时间</th>\n<th>通知渠道</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>P0</td>\n<td>Crash-free &lt; 97% 或 P0 API 全量超时</td>\n<td>5 min</td>\n<td>PagerDuty/电话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P1</td>\n<td>Crash-free &lt; 99% 或新增 Top 崩溃影响 &gt;1% 用户</td>\n<td>30 min</td>\n<td>Slack/飞书 + 邮件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P2</td>\n<td>单 Issue 24h 增长 &gt;200% 或 ANR-free &lt; 99.5%</td>\n<td>当日</td>\n<td>消息通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P3</td>\n<td>新增低频 Issue 或性能 P90 退化 &lt;20%</td>\n<td>下迭代</td>\n<td>周报</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"告警规则配置\">告警规则配置</h2><h3 id=\"静态阈值-vs-动态基线\">静态阈值 vs 动态基线</h3><p>静态阈值（如&quot;崩溃率 &gt; 2% 则告警&quot;）简单但容易误报——周末流量低时分母小，少量崩溃就触发。动态基线更合理：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Anomaly</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>current</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>baseline</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mtext>baseline</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Anomaly} = \\frac{V_{\\text{current}} - \\mu_{\\text{baseline}}}{\\sigma_{\\text{baseline}}} &gt; k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Anomaly</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">baseline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">current</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">baseline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>baseline</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_{\\text{baseline}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">baseline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mtext>baseline</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_{\\text{baseline}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">baseline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为过去 7 天同时段的均值和标准差，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 为灵敏度系数（通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 对应 99.7% 置信度）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"复合条件告警\">复合条件告警</h3><p>单一指标告警容易误报。复合条件更精准：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 示例：Firebase Crashlytics + Cloud Functions 告警规则&#10;alert:&#10;  name: &#39;critical_crash_spike&#39;&#10;  conditions:&#10;    - metric: crash_free_users_percent&#10;      operator: &#39;&lt;&#39;&#10;      value: 99.0&#10;      window: 1h&#10;    - metric: affected_users_count&#10;      operator: &#39;&gt;&#39;&#10;      value: 500&#10;      window: 1h&#10;    - metric: is_new_issue&#10;      value: true&#10;  actions:&#10;    - notify: oncall_channel&#10;      severity: P1&#10;    - create_jira:&#10;        project: MOBILE&#10;        type: Bug&#10;        priority: Critical\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 示例：Firebase Crashlytics + Cloud Functions 告警规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'critical_crash_spike'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  conditions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">crash_free_users_percent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      operator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C;'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">99.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      window</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">affected_users_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      operator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'>'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      window</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">is_new_issue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  actions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">notify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">oncall_channel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">P1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">create_jira</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        project</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">MOBILE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Bug</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        priority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Critical</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实时发布监控\">实时发布监控</h2><p>新版本发布后的前 24-48 小时是告警的关键窗口。Firebase 的 Release Monitoring Dashboard 提供：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>版本采用率曲线</strong>：新版本的用户渗透速度</li>\n<li><strong>版本间 crash-free 对比</strong>：新版 vs 前版的稳定性差异</li>\n<li><strong>新增 Issue 列表</strong>：只出现在新版本中的崩溃</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[新版本发布] --&gt; B[灰度 5% 用户]&#10;    B --&gt; C{24h 后&lt;br/&gt;Crash-free 对比}&#10;    C --&gt;|新版 ≥ 旧版| D[扩大至 25%]&#10;    C --&gt;|新版 &lt; 旧版 0.5%+| E[暂停灰度&lt;br/&gt;P1 告警]&#10;    D --&gt; F{48h 后&lt;br/&gt;全量评估}&#10;    F --&gt;|稳定| G[全量推送]&#10;    F --&gt;|退化| H[回滚决策]&#10;    E --&gt; I[定位新增 Issue]&#10;    I --&gt; J{可快速修复?}&#10;    J --&gt;|是| K[Hotfix → 重新灰度]&#10;    J --&gt;|否| L[回滚到前版]\">flowchart LR\n    A[新版本发布] --&gt; B[灰度 5% 用户]\n    B --&gt; C{24h 后&lt;br/&gt;Crash-free 对比}\n    C --&gt;|新版 ≥ 旧版| D[扩大至 25%]\n    C --&gt;|新版 &lt; 旧版 0.5%+| E[暂停灰度&lt;br/&gt;P1 告警]\n    D --&gt; F{48h 后&lt;br/&gt;全量评估}\n    F --&gt;|稳定| G[全量推送]\n    F --&gt;|退化| H[回滚决策]\n    E --&gt; I[定位新增 Issue]\n    I --&gt; J{可快速修复?}\n    J --&gt;|是| K[Hotfix → 重新灰度]\n    J --&gt;|否| L[回滚到前版]</pre><h2 id=\"on-call-轮值与升级机制\">On-Call 轮值与升级机制</h2><p>告警触发后的人工处理流程需要明确的职责和升级路径：</p>\n<p><strong>On-Call 轮值规则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每周轮换，工作日 + 周末覆盖</li>\n<li>主 On-Call + 备份 On-Call（主 15 分钟未响应自动升级到备份）</li>\n<li>P0 事件 30 分钟未解决自动升级到 Tech Lead</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>应急响应 Runbook</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>时间上限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1. 确认</td>\n<td>确认告警真实性，排除误报</td>\n<td>5 min</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. 评估影响</td>\n<td>受影响用户量、版本范围、地区分布</td>\n<td>10 min</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. 止血</td>\n<td>远程关闭功能开关/触发服务端降级/暂停灰度</td>\n<td>15 min</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. 定位根因</td>\n<td>分析崩溃堆栈/性能 trace/日志</td>\n<td>30 min</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5. 修复或回滚</td>\n<td>发布 Hotfix 或回退到稳定版本</td>\n<td>视修复复杂度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6. 验证恢复</td>\n<td>确认指标回到正常基线</td>\n<td>修复后 30 min</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7. 事后复盘</td>\n<td>写 Post-Mortem，更新告警规则</td>\n<td>事件后 48h</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"告警数据源整合\">告警数据源整合</h2><p>告警系统需要聚合多个数据源形成全局视图：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>崩溃数据</strong>：来自<a href=\"../crash-stability/crash-reporting-systems\">崩溃上报体系</a>——crash-free rate、新增 Issue</li>\n<li><strong>性能数据</strong>：来自<a href=\"../performance-monitoring/app-launch-metrics\">启动度量</a>和<a href=\"../performance-monitoring/network-api-monitoring\">网络监控</a>——P90 退化、API 错误率</li>\n<li><strong>业务数据</strong>：来自<a href=\"../analytics-fundamentals/attribution-funnel\">归因漏斗</a>——转化率突降</li>\n<li><strong>用户反馈</strong>：App Store 评分突降、客服工单激增</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些信号单独看可能不触发告警，但组合起来构成强信号——例如&quot;崩溃率微增 + 转化率下降 + 一星评价增加&quot;往往意味着用户正在经历同一个问题。告警系统的关联分析能力（correlation）决定了能否在早期发现系统性问题。</p>\n<p>从工具链的角度，告警配置是<a href=\"analytics-sdk-integration\">SDK 集成</a>的最后一环——SDK 采集数据、服务端聚合分析、告警规则触发通知、On-Call 人员响应处理，完成从数据采集到行动执行的闭环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>告警系统将被动监控转化为主动响应能力。多层告警体系按严重程度分级通知——P0 电话唤醒值班人、P3 归入周报。动态基线告警（基于标准差的异常检测）比静态阈值更适应流量波动。新版本发布后的 24-48 小时是关键监控窗口，灰度发布与 crash-free 对比构成版本质量门控。On-Call 轮值、升级机制和 Runbook 确保告警触发后有明确的响应路径。事后复盘（Post-Mortem）闭合整个学习循环。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"告警与应急响应","id":"告警与应急响应"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"告警设计原则","id":"告警设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"多层告警体系","id":"多层告警体系"},{"level":2,"text":"告警规则配置","id":"告警规则配置"},{"level":3,"text":"静态阈值 vs 动态基线","id":"静态阈值-vs-动态基线"},{"level":3,"text":"复合条件告警","id":"复合条件告警"},{"level":2,"text":"实时发布监控","id":"实时发布监控"},{"level":2,"text":"On-Call 轮值与升级机制","id":"on-call-轮值与升级机制"},{"level":2,"text":"告警数据源整合","id":"告警数据源整合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据隐私与合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/platform-operations/data-privacy-consent"},"next":null}